OL,3,GNEWSAPolice seize bike that raised
OL,4,A'serious concerns'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have seized a bike in Leicester
OL,7,Ffrom a young person that officers said
OL,8,Fraised "serious safety concerns".
OL,10,FThe South Leicester policing team said
OL,11,Fit seized the bike on Wednesday evening
OL,12,Fafter officers on patrol deemed it
OL,13,Fposed a "danger to the rider and other
OL,14,Froad users".
OL,16,FThe policing team added the condition
OL,17,Fof the bike, "particularly the wiring
OL,18,Fand electrical set-up, raises
OL,19,Fsignificant concerns about the risk of
OL,20,Fan electrical fault and a potentially
OL,21,Fdevastating fire".
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
